  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch expert support EPO She Exports training programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is an addition to the &apos;She Exports: female entrepreneurship training &amp; event&apos; project (MAN18UA01). As part of this project, the Export Promotion Office (EPO) and She Exports program has enlisted the support of a Dutch expert. The expert is working to train 20 Ukrainian female entrepreneurs who have been selected and will be trained to become export-ready, more innovative, and sustainable. The selected entrepreneurs will receive three training sessions focused on the skills needed as a female entrepreneur in the global economy: 1)	Business plan development: how to develop a sustainable business plan that fits global standards using the business model canvas methodology and lean validation? (a two-day training) 2)	Innovative entrepreneurship: how to be innovative and keep track of global trends? (a two-day training)3)	Entrepreneurship soft skills: among others communication, management and pitching. (a two-day training)    At the same time, capacity has been built with the EPO to provide qualitatively high standard entrepreneurship training sessions to female entrepreneurs with export potential.</narrative>
  </description>
